        <item>
            <title>1.40.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 22:04:00 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://macxterm.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>197</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.40.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.5</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Update macXterm from inside the app, with a relaunch when you choose.</p><ul><li>Check for Updates now opens the built-in updater.</li><li>Prevent duplicate update checks.</li><li>Keep Download from Website available in Settings for recovery.</li><li>Use smaller signed delta downloads for compatible recent versions.</li></ul><p>Relaunching ends active terminal connections. If an older version opens the website for manual checks, install this release once to get the new flow.</p>
]]></description>
